{"id":"49d62977f4c49d09","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-homogeneous-model.md","title":"Homogeneous Model","display":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"5.1","source_result":"Unnumbered definitions of alpha-homogeneous/homogeneous","source_pages_print":"297","source_pages_djvu":"313","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-homogeneous-model","aliases":["17-df-homogeneous-model"],"display":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model","depends_on":["[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-categoricity]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-8.2.1b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"5.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered definitions of alpha-homogeneous/homogeneous"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"297"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"313"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-homogeneous-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-homogeneous-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd3e154dc1b3bfce\" href=\"?note=cd3e154dc1b3bfce\" title=\"17-df-categoricity\">17-df-categoricity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-8.2.1b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> 的基数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有限元组满足记号采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 与参数满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为基数，允许有限指标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Iso}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Iso}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cd3e154dc1b3bfce\" href=\"?note=cd3e154dc1b3bfce\" title=\"17-df-categoricity\">17-df-categoricity</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\\)</span> 的原书对应范围限于无限模型；其下式作为总谓词时对有限模型取假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tp}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Aut}_L,\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L},\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{tp}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Aut}_L,\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M},\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L},\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\\)</span> 在此定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{tp}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\bar a)&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}:\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\}\\quad(\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Aut}_L(\\mathfrak M)&amp;=\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak M),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\\;[f:X\\hookrightarrow|\\mathfrak M|\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in X^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[f\\circ\\bar a])],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\;\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(f)\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists g\\;(\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(g)\\land f\\subseteq g\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak M)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\left|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\right|,L}(\\mathfrak M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{tp}_{\\mathfrak M}(\\bar a)&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}:\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\}\\quad(\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Aut}_L(\\mathfrak M)&amp;=\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak M),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\\;[f:X\\hookrightarrow|\\mathfrak M|\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in X^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[f\\circ\\bar a])],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L}(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\;\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(f)\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists g\\;(\\operatorname{PartialElem}_{\\mathfrak M}(g)\\land f\\subseteq g\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L(\\mathfrak M)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\left|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\right|,L}(\\mathfrak M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p297 的 α-homogeneous 是长度小于 α 的部分初等对应可延长一步；homogeneous 取 α=模型基数。此前有限元组同型可由自同构实现，描述的是另一种强齐性要求，不能在任意基数模型中作为原书定义。</p>\n<p>本轮重新读取供给 DjVu 第313页（印刷p297）：原书明确仅为无限基数引入 α-homogeneous。本地总谓词在有限模型上取假的延拓不应解释为原书关于有限模型的非齐性结论。</p>\n<p>这里的局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_{\\kappa,L}\\)</span> 对全部基数定义；其 Assertion 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\)</span> 条件使有限指标取假。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Homogeneous}_L\\)</span> 在有限载体基数处的调用也在本地域内。与原书的对应仍只主张无限指标。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-categoricity","status":"resolved","id":"cd3e154dc1b3bfce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-categoricity]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","e